From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 23:36:13 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] Add device recordings API and per-device speed limit source

- JT/T 1078 recording list query/playback (0x9205/0x1205, 0x9201/0x9202)
  with RecordingResource REST endpoints under api/recordings
- speedLimitMode (fixed/map/lowest) and speedLimitMultiplier per device/group
- Cache for map speed limit lookups (speedLimit.cacheTtl)

